              "text": "कसरत — kasrat — \"a workout; exercise\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "धावपटू रोज दोन तास कसरत करतात. dhāvpaṭū roj don tās kasrat kartāt. Runners work out for two hours every day."
            },
